{"id":12274,"path":"/grammar-points/a1/next-to-under-between-in-front-behind-etc/","parentId":540,"order":175,"section":"grammar-points","level":"a1","depth":3,"title":"Next to, under, between, in front of, behind, over, etc.","seo":{"title":"Next to, under, between, in front of, behind, over, etc. - Test-English","description":"Learn prepositions of place (next to, under, between, in front of, behind, over, etc.) with our grammar chart, fun exercises and examples!","image":"/media/uploads/A1%E2%80%93Grammar-prepositions-place.png"},"modified":"2026-02-18T18:45:03","kind":"lesson","parts":["<h3>Exercise 1</h3> <h5>Look at the pictures and choose the correct prepositions of place.</h5> <p><img src=\"/media/uploads/prepositions-of-place-exercise1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"278\" class=\"alignleft size-full wp-image-12368\" loading=\"lazy\"><br> </p><div data-quiz=\"589\"></div> <p></p>","<h3>Exercise 2</h3> <h5>Choose the correct preposition of place to complete these sentences.</h5> <div data-quiz=\"590\"></div>","<h3>Exercise 3</h3> <h5>Write the correct preposition of place in each gap. You must use all the prepositions in the table below.</h5> <div class=\"textBox\">above – behind – beside – between – in front of – next to – opposite – over – under</div> <p><img src=\"/media/uploads/prepositions-of-place-exercise_3.png\" alt=\"prepositions-of-place-exercise_3\" width=\"500\" height=\"352\" class=\"alignleft size-full wp-image-12387\" loading=\"lazy\"><br> </p><div data-quiz=\"591\"></div> <p></p>"],"explanation":"<p><img src=\"/media/uploads/prepositions_of_place.png\" alt=\"Grammar chart with illustrations of an alien and dragons demonstrating the use of prepositions of place such as next to, between, opposite, in front of, behind, above, over, and under.\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-12384\" loading=\"lazy\"></p> <h6></h6> <h4>Next to / beside</h4> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>We had a picnic <span><strong>next to/beside</strong></span> the river.</em></li> <li><em>Come and sit <span><strong>next to/beside</strong></span> me.</em></li> </ul> <h4>Between</h4> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>I live in a small town <span><strong>between</strong></span> Liverpool and Manchester.</em></li> <li><em>She is sleeping <span><strong>between</strong></span> her mum and dad.&nbsp;</em></li> </ul> <h4>In front of</h4> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>John sits <span><strong>in front of</strong></span> me in class.</em></li> <li><em>You are always <span><strong>in front of</strong></span> the mirror.</em></li> </ul> <h4>Behind</h4> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>She is hiding <span><strong>behind</strong></span> the curtains.&nbsp;</em></li> <li><em>We hang our coats <span><strong>behind</strong></span> the door.&nbsp;</em></li> </ul> <h4>Opposite</h4> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>I live <span><strong>opposite</strong></span> the supermarket</em> (=on the other side of the road)</li> <li><em>I am sitting <span><strong>opposite</strong></span> him</em> (=facing him)</li> </ul> <h4>Under</h4> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>The cat is hiding <span><strong>under</strong></span> the bed.</em></li> <li><em>Why are your shoes <span><strong>under</strong></span> the table?</em></li> <li><em>I’m wearing a white shirt <span><strong>under</strong></span> the jersey.</em></li> </ul> <h4>Above / over</h4> <p><a href=\"/grammar-points/shorts/above-vs-over-grammar-shorts/\"><strong>Above</strong> and <strong>over</strong></a> mean ‘at or to a higher position’. <strong>Over</strong> is more common.</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>She lives in an apartment <span><strong>above/over</strong></span> the grocery store.&nbsp;</em></li> <li><em>There is a shelf <span><strong>above/over </strong></span>the sink.&nbsp;</em></li> </ul>","quizzes":[{"id":589,"questions":[{"id":5030,"num":"1","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>There is a cat <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> the table. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["next to","under","above","between","behind"]}]},{"id":5031,"num":"2","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>The woman is sleeping <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> the books.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["above","next to","behind","in front of","under"]}]},{"id":5032,"num":"3","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>There are some clouds <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> the building.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["beside","above","behind","under","opposite"]}]},{"id":5033,"num":"4","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Janet is sitting <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> Tom. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["next to","in front of","behind","between","opposite"]}]},{"id":5034,"num":"5","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>There is a cat <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> the dogs.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["between","beside","above","in front of","under"]}]},{"id":5035,"num":"6","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Janet is sitting <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> Tom. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["in front of","behind","next to","between","opposite"]}]},{"id":5036,"num":"7","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Janet is sitting <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> a blond woman.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["in front of","beside","above","opposite","behind"]}]},{"id":5037,"num":"8","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Linda is sitting <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> Jack and Harry. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["between","behind","opposite","next to","above"]}]},{"id":5038,"num":"9","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>The ball is <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> the net.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["under","over","behind","beside","in front of"]}]},{"id":5039,"num":"10","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>The dog is standing <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> the cat.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["behind","next to","between","in front of","opposite"]}]}]},{"id":590,"questions":[{"id":5040,"num":"1","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>The ball is _____ the dog.<br> <img src=\"/med